                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#15v">-15v</locus>وَإًنَّ الفَضْلَ بِيَدِ اللهِ يُؤْتِيْهِ مَنْ يَشَأُ وَللهُ ذُوْ الفَضْلِ العَظِيْمِ</explicit>
                     <note>51:31-57:29. Twelve lines a page. Titles of suras rubricated. Diacritics and vowels with a thinner qalam. Catchwords from another hand. Deletions. In the margins, mark of ǧuz' (1v) and ḥizb (8r) in red color. Corrections. The identification of the scribe is based on notes in ASH00276 (fol. 13r) and ASH00265 (fol. 1r).</note>
